%% Source: docs/blueprint/BP-01-module-map.md
%% Diagram: Module Layers

flowchart TD
    Source["Source files on disk"]
    Adapters["adapters/<br/>read-only parsers<br/>change detection, IDs, normalization"]
    Pipeline["pipeline/<br/>THE BRAIN<br/>ingest, push, watch, schedule"]
    Store["db/<br/>SQLite buffer<br/>schema, CRUD, sync, search"]
    Sinks["sinks/<br/>remote delivery<br/>Postgres, S3, webhook"]

    Source --> Adapters --> Pipeline
    Pipeline --> Store
    Store --> Pipeline
    Pipeline --> Sinks

    Daemon["daemon/<br/>process lifecycle"] -. owns runtime state .-> Pipeline
    Commands["commands/<br/>thin CLI wrappers"] -. call into .-> Pipeline
    Commands -. control .-> Daemon
    Config["config.ts<br/>durable user intent<br/>read-only at runtime"] -. loaded at startup .-> Pipeline
    Routing["routing.ts<br/>pure sink matching"] -. used during push .-> Pipeline
